  "∫(φ₁′)² = {K}, ∫fφ₁ = {F}, donc α = {al}.": "∫(φ₁′)² = {K}, ∫fφ₁ = {F}, so α = {al}.",
  "−u″ = {f} sur ]0 ; 1[, u(0) = u(1) = 0. Galerkin avec V_h = span(φ₁), où {hat}. Calcule u_h = αφ₁. Choisis d'abord chaque action.": "−u″ = {f} on ]0 ; 1[, u(0) = u(1) = 0. Galerkin with V_h = span(φ₁), where {hat}. Compute u_h = αφ₁. First choose each action.",
