  "u_h(xⱼ) = uⱼ = u(xⱼ) : en 1D, la méthode est exacte aux nœuds": "u_h(xⱼ) = uⱼ = u(xⱼ): in 1D, the method is exact at the nodes",
  "La matrice de rigidité est K = (1/h)·tridiag(−1, 2, −1)": "The stiffness matrix is K = (1/h)·tridiag(−1, 2, −1)",
