  "Kᵢⱼ = ∫φᵢ′φⱼ′ = (1/h)·(2, −1) et Fᵢ = ∫φᵢ = h. Entre les nœuds, u_h est affine et u est une parabole.": "Kᵢⱼ = ∫φᵢ′φⱼ′ = (1/h)·(2, −1) and Fᵢ = ∫φᵢ = h. Between the nodes, u_h is affine and u is a parabola.",
  "Complète la méthode des éléments finis P1 (N fonctions chapeau intérieures, h = 1/(N + 1)) : Kᵢⱼ = ∫φᵢ′φⱼ′, Fᵢ = ∫φᵢ.": "Complete the P1 finite element method (N interior hat functions, h = 1/(N + 1)): Kᵢⱼ = ∫φᵢ′φⱼ′, Fᵢ = ∫φᵢ.",
  "−u″ = {f} sur ]0 ; 1[, u(0) = u(1) = 0, V₁ = span(φ₁), {d}. On cherche u₁ = αφ₁ par Galerkin. Que vaut α ?": "−u″ = {f} on ]0 ; 1[, u(0) = u(1) = 0, V₁ = span(φ₁), {d}. We look for u₁ = αφ₁ by Galerkin. What is α?",
  "le lagrangien": "the Lagrangian",
  "les deux cas de la complémentarité": "the two cases of complementarity",
  "gradient d'une forme quadratique": "gradient of a quadratic form",
