  "Le multiplicateur serait λ = {v1} < 0 : ce point n'est pas un minimum sous contrainte.": "The multiplier would be λ = {v1} < 0: this point is not a constrained minimum.",
  "L(x, λ) = {d} − λ·({v1}). La stationnarité :": "L(x, λ) = {d} − λ·({v1}). Stationarity:",
