  "par ∂L/∂x = 0, et λ ≥ 0": "from ∂L/∂x = 0, and λ ≥ 0",
  "Minimiser f(x) = {f} sous la contrainte {g}. Écris les conditions KKT et résous-les. Choisis d'abord chaque action.": "Minimize f(x) = {f} subject to the constraint {g}. Write the KKT conditions and solve them. First choose each action.",
