  "λ = 0 et x = {a}, qui respecte {d}.": "λ = 0 and x = {a}, which satisfies {d}.",
  "Le système KKT [[I, −Bᵀ], [B, 0]]·(q ; μ) = (0 ; c) donne q = μ·bᵀ, puis b·q = c. Le multiplicateur :": "The KKT system [[I, −Bᵀ], [B, 0]]·(q ; μ) = (0 ; c) gives q = μ·bᵀ, then b·q = c. The multiplier:",
