  "Algorithme de Thomas pour la matrice tridiagonale de diagonale a, sur-diagonale c et sous-diagonale d : {D}. On a γ₁ = c₁/a₁ = {g1}. Calcule ℓ₂ = a₂ − d₁γ₁.": "Thomas algorithm for the tridiagonal matrix with diagonal a, superdiagonal c and subdiagonal d: {D}. We have γ₁ = c₁/a₁ = {g1}. Compute ℓ₂ = a₂ − d₁γ₁.",
